recting","gender":2,"profile_path":null}]},"alternativeTitles":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"KungFu Stuntmen","type":"Documentary"},{"iso_3166_1":"CN","title":"龙虎武师","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Kung Fu Stuntmen: Never Say No!","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt15392272","wikidata_id":"Q131274951","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":780,"name":"kung fu"},{"id":222228,"name":"cinema history"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"CN","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"zh","note":"丝绸之路国际电影节","release_date":"2020-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","type":1},{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"zh","note":"","release_date":"2021-08-28T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"HK","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2021-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"JP","release_dates":[{"certification":"G","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2023-01-06T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"KR","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2023-01-26T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"龙虎武师","overview":"影片集结洪金宝、袁和平、程小东、元华、甄子丹、钱嘉乐等华语电影最强“武师阵容”，首次全方位揭秘香港龙虎武师长达六十余年风云变幻，展现中国功夫影人搏命人生路。","tagline":"喋血油尖旺 对抗好莱坞！"},{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"Kung Fu Stuntmen","overview":"A new documentary film revisits the golden age of kung fu stuntmen and action directors in Hong Kong during the 1960s-'80s, exploring their pain and struggles. The documentary is a tribute to kung fu stuntmen. “They risked their lives for stunts,” said kung fu choreographer Yuen Bin. In their heyday, these stuntmen and choreographers presented the best, most creative and most complicated kung fu fight sequences anywhere in the world, creating stunts that looked seemingly impossible.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Kung Fu Stuntmen","overview":"Ce documentaire revient sur l'âge d'or des cascadeurs de kung-fu et des réalisateurs de films d'action à Hong Kong dans les années 1960 à 1980, en explorant leurs souffrances et leurs difficultés. Le documentaire est un hommage aux cascadeurs de kung-fu. \"Ils ont risqué leur vie pour les cascades\", a déclaré le chorégraphe de kung-fu Yuen Bin. À leur apogée, ces cascadeurs et chorégraphes présentaient les meilleures séquences de combat de kung-fu au monde, les plus créatives et les plus compliquées, créant des cascades qui semblaient impossibles.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"TW","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"龍虎武師","overview":"這是一部首次全方位揭秘香港龍虎武師長達60餘年風雲變幻的紀錄片，歷時兩年，訪問及拍攝了近百位武行前輩與入行新人，集合了洪金寶、成龍、袁和平、程小東、甄子丹等動作明星及著名武術指導，以及徐克、劉偉強、吳思遠等著名導演，以及錢嘉樂、李忠志、谷軒昭等中生代武術指導，還有火星、劉允、小侯、黎強權、鍾發等前輩武師，也悉數登場。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"龍虎武師","overview":"記錄香港武行六十年風雲 展現真功夫 特技人搏命人生路 洪金寶、袁和平、甄子丹、程小東、元華、董瑋、錢嘉樂、徐克、元德、劉偉強吳思遠、曾志偉、熊欣欣、錢小豪、元武、火星……等前輩+最強武師陣容共同分享 記錄了香港影史上一個最特別的群體，就是“龍虎武師” 龍虎武師是香港電影行業中一個特別的存在，當年動作片、功夫片盛行之時，需要大量的武師在片中出演小角色來襯託大明星的風採。他們當中有些人後來成了著名的武術指導和大明星，但大多數人一輩子都在默默無聞地為電影付出著。他們的敬業精神與奉獻精神不但激勵了很多電影人，也讓無數影迷至今仍念念不忘。台上一分鐘，台下不光十年功，還有不為人知的淚與痛，他們就是龍虎武師，永遠是 Never say NO!","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"견자단의 용호무사","overview":"홍콩 영화의 큰 축이었던 쿵푸 배우와 스턴트맨들의 이야기를 다룬 다큐멘터리 영화","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"カンフースタントマン 龍虎武師","overview":"1970年代から1990年代にかけて、香港映画界はブルース・リー、サモ・ハン、ジャッキー・チェン、ジェット・リー、ドニー・イェンらを輩出してきた。一方、スタントマンたちは映画の現場で危険なアクションに挑み、多くのアクションスターたちの代役を務めた。香港スタントマン協会の全面協力のもと、彼らの証言やアーカイブ映像を交えて香港映画のスタントやアクションの歴史を描く。","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"31euyjQHIew","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name"